Still a good game, but some things became much worse than in FM17.
– matches are buggy as hell (awful cameras, replays, notifications, assists are credited to wrong players);
– scouting system lacks UX love, e.g. you can't just scout a player and get a report in the inbox;
– some actions need more clicks than before;
– AI is still pretty bad (just look at Man City squad after a year or two);
